{"v":4,"catch":"升級動物園，建造新動物園，成為獨一無二的大亨！","desc":"Idle Zoo 是一款有趣的遊戲，您將經營一個需要新鮮管理的動物園！\n成為一名富有的投資者並修復全國各地的動物園。 你需要修復舊動物園並建造新動物園。\n在那裡放置許多不同的動物，讓你的動物園繁榮發展。\n一定要在你的動物園裡建立創收場所。\n通過獲得新的動物，你將使動物園變得更有吸引力，並推動自己成為真正的動物園大亨！","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2023-08-10","genres":["策略","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","葡萄牙文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c45d062f5f56016fc03d1be5637690d6e260835e2e8e098fc1e2729fa1c1d4d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a095ea9a4ed444273d3deec549dd014fe418e0d4ee906a759621fac393e2d40.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1b5f6c75f5977acd760dea37f04db82e4c2d8c2e69205b144cb94b96a33bacb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fdd58cabd01ab4c50e5cf65024489f623ad63b73b0ce2efa4ec4b82cf00751de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53b74cbe570b1516cfbb9ee1ef2bad94e07b3d4042a197abd9a01ac533e9ab31.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/27c8d09c5c7a874ad0d30105f119ef8dd5c53d4938101a56494464435f90ad27.jpg"],"titleId":"010094201bb06000","dlc":[]}